      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but was it just the greeks and romans? i feel like i read something about the middle ages or maybe some stuff in asia or africa that helped with science and math too. like, did anything happen outside of europe that actually shaped modern stuff, or was europe pretty much the only thing that mattered for progress?",
